  vendorName: Clerk Carmichael
  offerText: Those heavy brass prototypes on your desk are entirely obsolete. Let
    my porters haul them to the scrap yard, and I will hand you a few coins for the
    metal.
  acceptResultText: You take the spare change and the heavy brass is removed. Your
    desk is finally clear for work.
  rejectResultText: You keep the heavy brass items, frustrated as they continue to
    stubbornly take up half your workspace.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: An independent inventor recognizes your brass prototypes as
    the missing piece for his engine! He buys them from you for an absolute fortune.
